1
00:00:00,344 --> 00:00:02,141
I keep coming back to this one.

2
00:00:03,042 --> 00:00:04,478
Forty minutes out of Hyderabad,

3
00:00:04,998 --> 00:00:07,832
and the loudest thing here is the birds.

4
00:00:08,761 --> 00:00:10,455
This forest was already here —

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,160
they built around it.

6
00:00:13,170 --> 00:00:14,299
That roof is actually alive,

7
00:00:14,299 --> 00:00:18,124
that's grass growing on top of the house.

8
00:00:19,076 --> 00:00:21,069
Come see it yourself, at this hour.

9
00:00:21,670 --> 00:00:23,527
Message us, we'll walk you through it.
